WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.583
<b>In the previous two verses,</b>

2
00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:34.916
<b>Lord Krishna explained that </b>
<b>the senses are restless</b>

3
00:00:34.916 --> 00:00:39.583
<b>and can lead the mind astray if left unchecked.</b>

4
00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:44.166
<b>He also revealed that an </b>
<b>enlightened soul (Sthitaprajna)</b>

5
00:00:44.166 --> 00:00:50.500
<b>naturally rises above attachments</b>
<b>upon attaining supreme knowledge.</b>

6
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.166
<b>Hearing this, one might wonder</b>

7
00:00:54.166 --> 00:00:58.750
<b>if we can directly pursue the path </b>
<b>of becoming Sthitaprajna,</b>

8
00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:01.916
<b>why bother controlling the senses?</b>

9
00:01:01.916 --> 00:01:05.166
<b>Lord Krishna now clarifies this very doubt.</b>

10
00:01:05.166 --> 00:01:06.291
<b>He states that</b>

11
00:01:06.291 --> 00:01:14.208
<b>one who controls their senses and focuses </b>
<b>their meditation on Him through yoga</b>

12
00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:16.708
<b>becomes steady in wisdom,</b>

13
00:01:16.708 --> 00:01:18.958
<b>attaining the state of Sthitaprajna.</b>

14
00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:26.541
<b>In other words, the path to becoming Sthitaprajna</b>
<b>inevitably passes through sensory control.</b>

15
00:01:31.375 --> 00:01:33.666
<b>This is the first time in the Bhagavad Gita</b>

16
00:01:33.666 --> 00:01:36.875
<b>where Lord Krishna refers to Himself</b>

17
00:01:36.875 --> 00:01:41.625
<b>and emphasizes the importance of </b>
<b>focusing one's attention on Him.</b>

18
00:01:41.625 --> 00:01:46.250
<b>He explains that protecting the </b>
<b>senses from harmful attachments</b>

19
00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:53.208
<b>and focusing on Him through yoga is </b>
<b>the path to attaining steady wisdom.</b>

20
00:01:53.208 --> 00:01:54.791
<b>To understand this further</b>

21
00:01:54.791 --> 00:02:02.208
<b>if you save your precious time by</b>
<b>abandoning life's unnecessary activities,</b>

22
00:02:02.208 --> 00:02:07.458
<b>wouldn't it make sense to</b>
<b>utilize this saved time wisely?</b>

23
00:02:07.458 --> 00:02:11.916
<b>It should be invested in </b>
<b>personal and spiritual growth.</b>

24
00:02:11.916 --> 00:02:12.958
<b>Similarly,</b>

25
00:02:12.958 --> 00:02:15.500
<b>when you control your senses</b>

26
00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:18.666
<b>and protect them from </b>
<b>unnecessary attachments,</b>

27
00:02:18.666 --> 00:02:24.250
<b>it's better to channel them purposefully rather </b>
<b>than keeping them dormant.</b>

28
00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:30.791
<b>And this purposeful direction is focusing</b>
<b>your attention on Lord Krishna.</b>

29
00:02:30.791 --> 00:02:32.375
<b>Think of it this way</b>

30
00:02:32.375 --> 00:02:38.291
<b>to improve your physical health, </b>
<b>you must follow two principles:</b>

31
00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:39.083
<b>First</b>

32
00:02:39.083 --> 00:02:42.166
<b>Stay away from unhealthy food</b>

33
00:02:42.166 --> 00:02:42.958
<b>Second</b>

34
00:02:42.958 --> 00:02:46.750
<b>Follow a health expert's guidance.</b>

35
00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:53.916
<b>Make lifestyle changes as advised, </b>
<b>choose balanced nutrition</b>

36
00:02:53.916 --> 00:02:54.916
<b>Similarly,</b>

37
00:02:54.916 --> 00:03:01.750
<b>Krishna prescribes two principles for </b>
<b>achieving excellent spiritual health:</b>

38
00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:02.666
<b>First</b>

39
00:03:02.666 --> 00:03:05.708
<b>Prevent your senses from wandering</b>

40
00:03:05.708 --> 00:03:06.875
<b>Second</b>

41
00:03:06.875 --> 00:03:13.458
<b>Practice focusing your attention </b>
<b>on Krishna through yoga.</b>

42
00:03:13.458 --> 00:03:14.208
<b>Here,</b>

43
00:03:14.208 --> 00:03:18.625
<b>focusing on Krishna has a broader meaning</b>

44
00:03:18.625 --> 00:03:25.291
<b>it includes living life according to</b>
<b>His teachings and guidance.</b>

45
00:03:25.291 --> 00:03:27.333
<b>Krishna's ultimate desire</b>

46
00:03:27.333 --> 00:03:31.291
<b>is for humans to rise above their </b>
<b>worldly sensory attachments</b>

47
00:03:31.291 --> 00:03:39.041
<b>and claim their rightful spiritual position </b>
<b>a place of absolute bliss.</b>

48
00:03:43.375 --> 00:03:48.166
<b>When a student finds a </b>
<b>subject extremely difficult,</b>

49
00:03:48.166 --> 00:03:53.208
<b>with many aspects causing confusion,</b>

50
00:03:53.208 --> 00:03:58.041
<b>what does a good teacher do?</b>

51
00:03:58.041 --> 00:04:03.416
<b>They simplify the subject and explain </b>
<b>the essence of important principles.</b>

52
00:04:03.416 --> 00:04:13.291
<b>They guide the student away from confusing </b>
<b>activities and misleading sources of knowledge.</b>

53
00:04:13.291 --> 00:04:21.750
<b>And they encourage focus on </b>
<b>the suggested key principles.</b>

54
00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:24.166
<b>A good teacher knows</b>

55
00:04:24.166 --> 00:04:25.500
<b>that simplicity</b>

56
00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:30.833
<b>and concentration are </b>
<b>the tools for passing life's tests.</b>

57
00:04:30.833 --> 00:04:32.875
<b>Similarly,</b>

58
00:04:32.875 --> 00:04:35.541
<b>in life's classroom,</b>

59
00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:43.458
<b>one must follow their teacher's </b>
<b>guidance with discipline and focus.</b>

60
00:04:43.458 --> 00:04:48.041
<b>In this context, life's classroom </b>
<b>differs from school.</b>

61
00:04:48.041 --> 00:04:53.250
<b>Here, you must choose your own teacher.</b>

62
00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.000
<b>So</b>

63
00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.500
<b>who is the right teacher?</b>

64
00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:01.500
<b>Sometimes people consider their </b>
<b>intellect as their teacher,</b>

65
00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:05.041
<b>sometimes an experienced person.</b>

66
00:05:05.041 --> 00:05:07.916
<b>Two points are crucial here:</b>

67
00:05:07.916 --> 00:05:09.666
<b>First,</b>

68
00:05:09.666 --> 00:05:12.041
<b>regardless of the teacher,</b>

69
00:05:12.041 --> 00:05:16.250
<b>their source of knowledge must be pure,</b>

70
00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:18.666
<b>otherwise confusion will prevail</b>

71
00:05:18.666 --> 00:05:20.125
<b>Second,</b>

72
00:05:20.125 --> 00:05:23.833
<b>no matter how experienced someone is,</b>

73
00:05:23.833 --> 00:05:31.500
<b>that experience has limits, and their </b>
<b>knowledge is bounded by these limits</b>

74
00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:32.708
<b>But</b>

75
00:05:32.708 --> 00:05:36.875
<b>if you accept the Supreme Being as your teacher,</b>

76
00:05:36.875 --> 00:05:40.333
<b>what source could be more appropriate?</b>

77
00:05:40.333 --> 00:05:47.625
<b>A source where experience</b>
<b>and knowledge know no bounds.</b>

78
00:05:47.625 --> 00:05:50.625
<b>Here is my invitation.</b>

79
00:05:50.625 --> 00:05:59.416
<b>Both I and my teachings are available</b>
<b>to anyone who seeks supreme knowledge.</b>

80
00:05:59.416 --> 00:06:02.291
<b>It would be my pleasure</b>

81
00:06:02.291 --> 00:06:11.333
<b>to not only introduce every person walking </b>
<b>this path, just like Arjuna, to their spiritual truth</b>

82
00:06:11.333 --> 00:06:12.375
<b>but</b>

83
00:06:12.375 --> 00:06:15.500
<b>also to protect them along the way.</b>

84
00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:19.416
<b>Through your efforts to control your senses</b>

85
00:06:19.416 --> 00:06:22.916
<b>and following my guided path,</b>

86
00:06:22.916 --> 00:06:30.500
<b>you can experience peaceful stability </b>
<b>even in this turbulent world, </b>

87
00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:35.375
<b>finding joy in every situation. </b>

88
00:06:35.375 --> 00:06:37.125
<b>Come,</b>

89
00:06:37.125 --> 00:06:38.625
<b>hold my hands.</b>

90
00:06:43.375 --> 00:06:51.250
<b>When training children, </b>
<b>teaching self-control is crucial.</b>

91
00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:52.333
<b>But</b>

92
00:06:52.333 --> 00:06:59.416
<b>their gentle minds cannot learn </b>
<b>this self-control through harshness.</b>

93
00:06:59.416 --> 00:07:02.541
<b>They need teaching,</b>

94
00:07:02.541 --> 00:07:04.791
<b>a teacher</b>

95
00:07:04.791 --> 00:07:11.833
<b>who is both gentle and capable </b>
<b>of providing proper guidance.</b>

96
00:07:11.833 --> 00:07:15.625
<b>Having such a guide in life,</b>

97
00:07:15.625 --> 00:07:18.083
<b>such a helper,</b>

98
00:07:18.083 --> 00:07:21.041
<b>provides immense strength.</b>

99
00:07:21.041 --> 00:07:29.541
<b>A strength that enables children </b>
<b>to face any of life's challenges.</b>

100
00:07:29.541 --> 00:07:32.875
<b>You keep showing them the path,</b>

101
00:07:32.875 --> 00:07:35.791
<b>and I will show you yours.</b>

102
00:07:35.791 --> 00:07:38.333
<b>You protect them from straying,</b>

103
00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:39.833
<b>and I</b>

104
00:07:39.833 --> 00:07:42.666
<b>will keep you safe from wandering.</b>

105
00:07:47.125 --> 00:07:49.375
<b>Whether in personal</b>

106
00:07:49.375 --> 00:07:50.916
<b>or professional life,</b>

107
00:07:50.916 --> 00:07:55.500
<b>Whether you're highly experienced or not,</b>

108
00:07:55.500 --> 00:08:00.083
<b>Sometimes you inevitably get stuck in problems</b>

109
00:08:00.083 --> 00:08:04.583
<b>that seem to have no solution.</b>

110
00:08:04.583 --> 00:08:09.583
<b>And when you've reached the</b>
<b>limits of your experience,</b>

111
00:08:09.583 --> 00:08:14.666
<b>trying to find solutions alone becomes futile.</b>

112
00:08:14.666 --> 00:08:19.416
<b>In such times, it's necessary </b>
<b>to seek help from others.</b>

113
00:08:19.416 --> 00:08:24.541
<b>Someone with more experience in that context,</b>

114
00:08:24.541 --> 00:08:28.041
<b>who can suggest new solutions.</b>

115
00:08:28.041 --> 00:08:34.041
<b>Having such supporters makes </b>
<b>life's struggles easier.</b>

116
00:08:34.041 --> 00:08:38.833
<b>I hope you have such supporters,</b>

117
00:08:38.833 --> 00:08:43.666
<b>and that you too continue helping others.</b>

118
00:08:43.666 --> 00:08:44.916
<b>But</b>

119
00:08:44.916 --> 00:08:47.458
<b>life is busy,</b>

120
00:08:47.458 --> 00:08:51.291
<b>everyone has their circumstances.</b>

121
00:08:51.291 --> 00:08:52.625
<b>Perhaps</b>

122
00:08:52.625 --> 00:08:58.916
<b>in your hour of need, someone</b>
<b>might be unable to give you time.</b>

123
00:08:58.916 --> 00:09:00.791
<b>Don't worry,</b>

124
00:09:00.791 --> 00:09:02.375
<b>in any situation, </b>

125
00:09:02.375 --> 00:09:03.958
<b>at any time,</b>

126
00:09:03.958 --> 00:09:06.875
<b>be it personal or professional life</b>

127
00:09:06.875 --> 00:09:13.666
<b>you will find a well-wisher, </b>
<b>a guide standing ready.</b>

128
00:09:13.666 --> 00:09:16.541
<b>Here is my invitation.</b>

129
00:09:16.541 --> 00:09:23.750
<b>Whenever in doubt, when no path </b>
<b>seems clear, come to my shelter.</b>

130
00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:28.750
<b>You will surely find solutions to </b>
<b>even the most difficult problems.</b>

131
00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.458
<b>The truth is,</b>

132
00:09:30.458 --> 00:09:35.166
<b>every solution lies within you,</b>

133
00:09:35.166 --> 00:09:39.000
<b>and I too reside within you.</b>

134
00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:42.791
<b>Your own Krishna.</b>

135
00:09:42.791 --> 00:09:48.791
<b>You only need to focus your attention.</b>

